      "id": "claim_4cdaf4466e4c4709afc964ee0c7903a0",
      "statement": "Security Key import/export uses only the termind-fido2-v1 metadata reference, not OpenSSH private-key input. Import trims surrounding whitespace, requires fewer than 16,384 UTF-8 bytes, decodes Base64 JSON, and validates a nonempty credential ID of at most 1023 bytes and a valid uncompressed P-256 public point; file imports require regular UTF-8 files no larger than 1 MiB and validate the reference before returning it.",
