    {
      "id": "claim_10d4494edd1f40148ccb80aeb908b643",
      "statement": "SSHPTYChannel.authenticate offers the Security Key public blob through libssh2_userauth_publickey_signed; its callback delegates asynchronous assertion signing through the connection exchange and returns a validated OpenSSH WebAuthn signature. Public-offer rejection does not invoke signing, native signing errors propagate immediately, and signing remains distinct from keyboard-interactive string answers. The callback extends a positive timeout by elapsed signing time and the authentication branch restores it. Shell integration is post-authentication, but connectPrepared runs preparation and optional integration probing/helper installation before PTY channel and shell startup.",
